<title>USA: Epitope names Armstrong as interim CEO.</title>
<headline>Epitope names Armstrong as interim CEO.</headline>
<dateline>BEAVERTON, Ore 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Epitope Inc said Charles Armstrong, a member of the board of directors, will serve as interim president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Armstrong will replace Adolph Ferro who will devote full time to his position as president and chief executive officer of the company's Agritope group, effective immediately.</p>
</text>
